It just feels like option three has the power to very easily make malgli.
Bob:  it's wrong, it's all wrong.
Dan:  what's wrong?
Bob:  everything.

This ambiguous little piece of conversation can easily be translated to
lojban with option 3 roda.
Bob:  toldrani .i roda toldrani
Dan:  .i ma toldrani
Bob:  roda go'i

Now, is the above "ambiguous" or "vague"
